// Title: Remote PowerShell Session (PS Module)
// ID: 96b9f619-aa91-478f-bacb-c3e50f8df575
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Roberto Rodriguez @Cyb3rWard0g, Tim Shelton
// Date: 2019-08-10
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1021.006
// Description: Detects remote PowerShell sessions
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (((ContextInfo like "*_ = ServerRemoteHost *" and ContextInfo like "*_wsmprovhost.exe*")) and not ((ContextInfo like "*_\\Windows\\system32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\Modules\\Microsoft.PowerShell.Archive\\Microsoft.PowerShell.Archive.psm1*")))
